§ `2. Do I need a licence, and am I committing an offence?`

-- Argument order: kind; day of the conduct; day read as at; installs; imports/sells/holds for sale; operates or has on own premises; services are received; under a licence; forces duty; Authority exemption; Ministerial order.
-- At home, using it, no licence and no exemption: s 20(1)(c) read with s 47, where the equipment is broadcasting apparatus for the two days.
